<title>CANADA: Canada pork agency details exports 1993 to 1995.</title>
<headline>Canada pork agency details exports 1993 to 1995.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The export promotion agency of Canada hog industry, Canada Pork International, detailed the value and tonnage of exports between 1993 and 1995.</p>
<p>	   Canadian Pork Exports by Product 1993-1995</p>
<p>Products (C$'000)	1993	 1994	  1995</p>
<p>Fresh/Chilled/Frozen   623,226    623,749     739,597</p>
<p>Processed		  105,058    136,521     169,203</p>
<p>Offal			 20,642     26,319	40,175</p>
<p>Fat			    8,838     12,257	18,573</p>
<p>TOTAL:		     757,764    798,846     967,548</p>
<p>	   Canadian Pork Exports by Product 1993-1995</p>
<p>Products (tonnes)	1993	 1994	  1995</p>
<p>Fresh/Chilled/Frozen   209,895    204,866     235,660</p>
<p>Processed		   32,298     34,865	40,609</p>
<p>Offal			 23,558     29,806	43,369</p>
<p>Fat			   12,715     16,344	21,420</p>
<p>TOTAL:		     278,466    285,881     341,058</p>
<p>--Gilbert Le Gras 204-947-3548</p>
</text>
